          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Followers today</span><span class="info-stat-val">Between 800,000 and one million (no year given); in 1998 about 40–50% lived in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/syria">Syria</a>, 30–40% in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lebanon">Lebanon</a>, 6–7% in Israel and 1–2% in Jordan. In 2021 about 60,000 lived in Venezuela and around 50,000 in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a>.</span></div>
